{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此梵語也，從用翻名，入王宮聚落衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應求一人為對首，羯磨云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若干"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "割截揲葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品下品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名中品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品上品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從用翻名入眾衣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "割截揲葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻院內道行雜作衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "割截、摺葉、揲葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具如鈔疏章服\n義等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悉辨如顯正儀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "防外道抽線之緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前却刺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準鈔\n亦得作馬齒縫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂左邊最外一條居下，以第二、三、四條次第相押以為葉相。鈔云：葉極廣應四指，極狹如󰎣麥，皆葉相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次第相押為葉相者，準上可解"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其縵刺縫并押葉，鳥足與挍葉\n是同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此義如下，\n為引感通傳明之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若據章服義，斥云佛胷萬字條條間施等，此為傳文所廢。\n\n又似據坐具為言，故下復云左尼師壇等。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本式作萬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不著則已，例如坐具揲四角等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂於四周緣中破緣兩邊縫中間，而其久固使不速壞，則與四分安\n緣之意頗合，但堅窂愈於四分耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大師舉本宗無文而答，以四周之緣元有兩縫，并破緣一縫合有三縫。今四分\n但云當安緣，則緣有兩縫耳，故曰絕三縫也。亦可應前問云三衣破緣而縫，今答中省却衣破緣而四字，故但\n云三縫。葢問廣而答略，筆削之便耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天神再答，文相可了。但十誦撿文未見，若後見文與此有異者，吾當的從"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大師問也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天神示也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作鉉，鼎耳曰鉉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具如感通傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業疏搭肩之文在前，傳繞左臂云文在後。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "揲亦無咎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即長一丈八寸，廣六尺三寸也。今內減為一尺八分，以當長中一丈八寸也。又減為六寸三分，以當廣中六尺\n三寸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即長九尺，廣五\n尺四寸。今減為九寸，以當長中九尺。又減為五寸四分，以當廣中五尺四寸也"}
{"id": null, "n": "0614a1701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0614a1701", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
